WEBVTT

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:06.072
We will use several small datasets because reshaping appears in many different situations.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:09.947
Admissions data gives us diagnosis categories.

00:00:09.947 --> 00:00:14.027
Sales data gives us products, months, and revenue.

00:00:14.027 --> 00:00:17.687
Survey responses give us question categories.

00:00:17.687 --> 00:00:21.217
Grades give us student and course combinations.

00:00:21.217 --> 00:00:26.622
We also have wide examples such as monthly sales and patient metrics.

00:00:26.622 --> 00:00:30.012
The goal is not to memorize one dataset.

00:00:30.012 --> 00:00:35.310
The goal is to recognize the same reshaping pattern across different kinds of data.
